{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/main.ts",
    "title": "服务端进程入口",
    "summary": "加载配置、构建并监听 Fastify 应用，同时为 SIGINT 与 SIGTERM 提供基础的优雅关闭处理。",
    "category": "implementation",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "startup",
        "title": "启动流程与模块关系",
        "body": "该文件是服务端进程的薄入口：先调用配置模块取得主机、端口等运行参数，再调用应用装配模块的 `buildApp`，最后让返回的 Fastify 实例开始监听。[[c1]] `buildApp` 内部负责创建 Store、运行管理器、记忆服务及反馈服务，因此入口本身不承载业务逻辑，只负责把配置交给应用层并启动进程。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "shutdown",
        "title": "关闭行为与边界",
        "body": "进程收到 `SIGINT` 或 `SIGTERM` 时会异步调用 `app.close()`，成功后以状态码 0 退出，可让 Fastify 停止接收请求并执行其关闭流程。[[c3]] 这里没有展示关闭失败的捕获、超时强退或重复信号保护；若 `app.close()` 拒绝，材料不足以确认进程最终如何退出。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "入口启动序列",
        "reason": "支持入口依次加载配置、构建应用并监听指定地址的说明。",
        "relation": "calls",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/main.ts",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 6
        },
        "quote": "import { buildApp } from \"./app.js\";\nimport { loadConfig } from \"./config.js\";\nconst config = loadConfig();\nconst { app } = await buildApp(config);\nawait app.listen({ port: config.port, host: config.host });\nconsole.log(`omem listening at http://${config.host}:${config.port}`);"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "应用装配初始化",
        "reason": "说明 buildApp 创建存储与记忆相关服务，支撑入口和应用装配模块的关系。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/app.ts",
          "startLine": 44,
          "endLine": 59
        },
        "quote": "export async function buildApp(\n  config: Config,\n  dependencies: {\n    lark?: LarkOnboardingService;\n    larkRuntime?: LarkRuntimeHost;\n  } = {},\n) {\n  if (![\"127.0.0.1\", \"localhost\", \"::1\"].includes(config.host) && !config.token)\n    throw Error(\"OMEM_TOKEN is required for a non-loopback bind\");\n  const app = Fastify"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "进程信号处理",
        "reason": "支持收到两类终止信号后关闭应用并退出的描述。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/main.ts",
          "startLine": 7,
          "endLine": 10
        },
        "quote": "for (const signal of [\"SIGINT\", \"SIGTERM\"] as const)\n  process.on(signal, () => {\n    void app.close().then(() => process.exit(0));\n  });"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "应用关闭失败或超过预期时间时是否需要记录错误并强制退出？",
        "why": "当前入口只处理关闭成功的 Promise 分支，材料没有给出失败与超时策略。",
        "nextStep": "结合运行部署要求检查或补充关闭失败、超时及重复信号测试。",
